title: Legislative Initiative
subtitle: A bill of PPS: taking it up costs this month's action, and the Sejm votes on it next month.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: parliament_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.initiativeCardAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card parliament.legislative_initiative (Z — 0.81, decisions of 20 X 2026): it replaces the cards of the unemployment bill D
// and of the parliamentary control of the army. At most five laws of a fixed order; taking one up is this month's action and
// moves relations at once; the next month the urgent card polish_initiative_vote puts it to the Sejm (technical reference 7.2).
PolishProjects.initiativeView(Q);
!}

= The legislative initiative

The club of PPS can file a bill of its own. We choose one matter, and next month the Sejm votes on it. A law passed in full leaves this card; one passed only in its limited version, rejected or withdrawn comes back after nine months.

- @unemployment
- @labor_inspection
- @progressive_tax
- @army_oversight
- @secular_school
- @autonomy
- @land_reform
- @public_works
- @workers_housing
- @tenants
- @old_age
- @abortion
- @skip
- @easy_discard

@unemployment
title: Protection of the unemployed
subtitle: [+ pl_ini_unemployment_line +]
view-if: {! return PolishProjects.initiativeIsShown(Q, 'unemployment') !}
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.initiativeStatus(Q, 'unemployment').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ini_unemployment_why +] [+ pl_ini_unemployment_line +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_ini_result = PolishProjects.initiativeFile(Q, 'unemployment');
!}
go-to: result

